sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend API
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant SD as Skills Discovery
  participant LLM as LLM adapter
  participant IM as Matching/Learning (deterministic)
  participant BA as Bias Audit
  U->>FE: enter work description + consent
  FE->>API: POST /profiles
  API-->>FE: 201 CareerProfile
  FE->>API: POST /workflows {profile_id}
  API-->>FE: 202 WorkflowState (extract_skills RUNNING)
  API->>O: run stage graph (background task)
  O->>SD: extract(profile)
  SD->>LLM: structured call (cached by input hash)
  LLM-->>SD: JSON per schema
  SD-->>O: SkillExtractionResult (ungrounded items dropped)
  par background
    O->>BA: baseline + age-cue variants
    BA->>LLM: variant extractions (cached)
  and human gate
    FE->>API: GET /workflows/{id} (poll 1.5s)
    API-->>FE: AWAITING_USER confirm_skills
    U->>FE: confirm / reject / add skills
    FE->>API: POST /skills/confirmation
  end
  O->>IM: match_roles(confirmed skills)
  IM-->>O: RoleRecommendation[]
  FE->>API: GET /results (recommendations)
  U->>FE: choose target role
  FE->>API: POST /role-selection
  par
    O->>IM: learning_plan
  and
    O->>SD: employer_readiness (LLM, grounded)
  end
  O-->>API: COMPLETED (or WITH_WARNINGS)
  FE->>API: GET /results
  API-->>FE: WorkflowResults
